# Domain Entity Usage

Enforces use of domain entities in services. Prevents services from working with raw dicts/JSON.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Writing services
- Processing data
- Creating or returning entities
- Need business logic and validation

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable domain patterns

